  "question": {
    "text": "The molar conductivity of a solution of a weak acid HX (0.01 M) is 10 times smaller than the molar conductivity of a solution of a weak acid HY (0.10 M). If <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8776;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></math> , the difference in their <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> values, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>)</mo></math> , is (Consider degree of ionization of both acids to &lt;&lt; 1)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8776;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8776;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></math> ...... (i)<br />Also, <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math> ,<br />So <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />(Where <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are degree of dissociation of HX and HY respectively)<br />Now, given that<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> ...... (ii)<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> , But <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#8810;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>"
